description = "Extends its legs extra long and strides into the space of the ally within 4 cells with the most Celerity, looming over it for 4 seconds. The ally gains 35% of FRAME's Celerity, and whenever it attacks, FRAME attacks its target too. FRAME makes no attacks of its own and gains no Charge meanwhile."
